# Voucher

## Invariant store

- vouchers.store_id IS NOT NULL -> checkout phai kiem tra voucher.store_id == order.store_id.
- vouchers.store_id IS NULL -> platform voucher (ap dung moi store).

## Invariant usage

- used_quantity <= total_quantity.
- CHECK constraint tuong ung o DB.

## Voucher percentage

- discount_value <= 100.
- CHECK constraint o DB.

## Quy tac

- Ap dung voucher o **service checkout** (sau khi split cart theo store, xem multi-vendor-order.mdc).
- Moi Order chi ap dung toi da 1 store-voucher + 1 platform-voucher.
- Voucher usage ghi vao voucher_usages (FK voucher_id, order_id, user_id).
- Rollback khi order cancel: xoa voucher_usage + decrement used_quantity.

## Endpoint (da co)

- GET /api/v1/vouchers - Buyer list voucher available.
- POST /api/v1/vouchers - Buyer claim voucher vao vi.
- GET /api/v1/seller/vouchers - Seller quan ly voucher store.
- POST /api/v1/seller/vouchers - Seller tao voucher store.
- PUT /api/v1/seller/vouchers/{id} - Seller cap nhat.
- DELETE /api/v1/seller/vouchers/{id} - Seller xoa.
- GET /api/v1/admin/vouchers - Admin quan ly platform voucher.
- POST /api/v1/admin/vouchers - Admin tao platform voucher.

## Voucher Code khi tao

- Code phai UNIQUE trong pham vi store (hoac platform neu voucher he thong).
- Su dung prefix de phan biet: STORE-XXXXX cho store, PLATFORM-XXXXX cho platform.

## Khi implement

- Endpoint Contract phai duoc liet ke trong docs/api/api-document.md.
- Tra migration-impact-matrix.mdc neu co migration moi.
- Viet test cho service (claim, validate store match, usage increment, rollback).